  <section xml:id="sec-places-for-discussions">
    <title>Places for discussions</title>

    <p>Data discussion site: <url href="https://github.com/PreTeXtBooks/lsrdata/issues/1">https://github.com/PreTeXtBooks/lsrdata/issues/1</url></p>

    <p>Chapter discussion site: <url href="https://github.com/PreTeXtBooks/lsrinstat/issues">https://github.com/PreTeXtBooks/lsrinstat/issues</url></p>
